  "calibration_scope": "Selected inspected Lean files and ordinary proofs; not the full compilable dependency closure. The transitive Lean build was not rerun.",
  "finite_verification": "Every source delta, projection, coordinate and row operation, inverse, expanded coefficient and literal printed residual is independently replayed. These finite checks are distinct from unbounded proof obligations.",
  "mathematical_contributions": [
    "Reuse the even cofinal CRT index C as the semantic Pell anchor.",
    "Delete the derived-label range using a strict product-separation lemma and independently authenticated constructor depth.",
    "Use t=128+4z^2, K=t^4, F=t^K to keep the final coefficient height small.",
    "Compose exact integral projections with balanced coordinate changes to obtain P215, and provide P213/P214 companions."
  ],
  "adaptations": [
    "Source producer imports portable polynomial helpers and reads source/parent225.",
    "Constructor-depth checker reads inherited/syntax and emits its certificate on stdout.",
    "Rebuild and top-level verifier are portable entry points.",
    "Optimization manifest paths are rebased; all equation and ordered certificate bytes are preserved.",
    "Historical absolute input paths inside unchanged certificates are descriptive and not used by the portable replay."
